169	    }
```
Note: the setter lower-cases the email (the Javadoc mistakenly says "address"). The DB column is defined in `src/main/resources/db/h2/schema.sql:38` and `db/hsqldb/schema.sql:45` (`email VARCHAR(255)`), and in the OpenAPI spec `src/main/resources/openapi.yml:2034` (`format: email`).

---

### 2. REST controller handling owner creation
**`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/OwnerRestControllerV1.java`** — full file shown above. The create/POST method (lines 101-114):
```java
