```
The controller implements the generated `OwnersApi` interface; the method name `addOwner` is what the advice classes key off of. (There is also `OwnerRestControllerV2` at `.../rest/controller/v2/OwnerRestControllerV2.java`, but it only exposes a paged `listOwnersPage` — no create.)

